    <section id="words-we-use">
      <title>Words we use</title>
      <dl>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Copyright</dt>
          <dd>The right of the person who made something to say what may be done with it.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Library</dt>
          <dd>A part of a program that someone else wrote and that other programs use.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Licence</dt>
          <dd>The permission that the maker of something gives you to use it, and the rules that come with it.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Licence name</dt>
          <dd>The short name of a licence, such as MIT or Apache-2.0. The names come from a public list that many programs use.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
    </section>
